        <mxCell id="architecture-note" value="AAP also runs independent acceptance on disposable guests; Lightwell discovery runs controller-side with standard Ansible uri. Stable Services / EndpointSlices connect OpenShift to AWS.&#10;Optional nginx MCP diagnostics are read-only; AWS defaults to AAP audit-facts RCA unless MCP is enabled. CNV is the alternative nginx backend, not used in this verified dual-app run." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#526578;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
